stacer (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port entire codebase from Qt5 to Qt6.
  * Require CMake 3.16+ and C++17.
  * Remove dead Unity/GNOME Settings page (defunct since Ubuntu 18.04).
  * Update Debian packaging for Qt6 build dependencies.
  * Modernize debhelper compat level to 13.
  * Fix Architecture from "all" to "any" (compiled binary).
  * Target Ubuntu 24.04+ (Noble Numbat).

